<title>USA: Classics Int'l Entertainment to be bought.</title>
<headline>Classics Int'l Entertainment to be bought.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Classics International Entertainment Inc said Tuesday it signed a letter of understanding to sell the company to  Educational Publications Inc in a stock swap.</p>
<p>The company said Educational Publications will issue 3.5 million common shares, preferred shares and warrants for Classics International shares and warrants. The deal is expected to close in mid-March, the company said.</p>
<p>Classics International develops and markets a line of comic books, study guides and interactive software products based on classic literary works.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
